sterious events that hint at something lurking beyond. Each realm tells part of a bigger story, and only the bravest will uncover the truth behind The Last Realm.", "short_description": "The Last Realm is a fun social game where you can hang out with friends, play games, and explore mysterious worlds. But stay alert not everything in the realms is as friendly as it seems."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/thelastrealm/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Time Level", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/thelastrealm/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "33428376596761483"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818916_2256473945162979_490847711858804133_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qh9gqKPzXIEQ7kNvwGQqvTa&_nc_oc=Adp369mJidxslqeWBZIw7iocdyWemmudnEkbcSHmtUejCwmvNjj_p7VYipWKXJaGjoY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQhgCITNYF_0aZBDWzpTUJD2cflICGURYQTx9Cat9gBUg&oe=6B0B148B"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "The Last Realm", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "cont